OL,3,GNEWSASwimming teacher, 82, retires
OL,4,Aafter 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA swimming teacher has hung up her
OL,7,Fwater wings and buoyancy aids at the
OL,8,Fage of 82, after almost 50 years in the
OL,9,Fjob.
OL,11,FLin West started teaching at Jack Hunt
OL,12,FPool and the Regional Pool in
OL,13,FPeterborough in the late 1970s.
OL,15,FOver the years it is estimated she has
OL,16,Fdelivered more than 30,000 swimming
OL,17,Flessons to about 400,000 students in
OL,18,Fthe city and some of her former pupils
OL,19,Fwent on to competitive swimming or
OL,20,Fbecame lifeguards.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
