OL,3,GNEWSASwimming teacher, 82, retires
OL,4,Aafter 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest said: "Getting a child or an adult
OL,7,Fto be able to swim - there is no better
OL,8,Ffeeling. That is what motivated me to
OL,9,Fkeep teaching for so long and I would
OL,10,Fstill continue to do it now, if only my
OL,11,Fbody would let me."
